              "image_url": "data:image/jpeg;base64,",
              "type": "input_image"
            },
            {
              "text": "Checklist. Give every item below exactly one disposition.\n- chk:ob:SF1@candidate: Every protected subject or feature named in the job requirements keeps its identity, shape, position and extent relative to the source.\n- chk:ob:SF2@candidate: The candidate is derived from the source: same scene, same camera, same projection; nothing rotated, stretched or cropped away.\n",
